<p>Your body becomes a nexus for the Fearscape, causing you to drag enemies towards you in a cone with a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 8,</acronym> dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">90, 121, 145, 165, 183</acronym> fire damage every turn.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>